### Positive Patterns ✅

- ✅ `GeneratedRegex` used for 3 core regexes (lines 13-19)
- ✅ `IsAllUpperCase` uses `foreach` loop instead of LINQ `.All()`
- ✅ `IsAsciiAlphanumeric` and `WordCount` use zero-allocation `foreach` loops
- ✅ `Slugify` uses `.ToLowerInvariant()` correctly
- ✅ Compiled regex fallback for pre-.NET 7 via `#if` directive

